.SH "نام (NAME)"
deb\-src\-files \- Debian distribute files format
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBdebian/files\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
This file contains the list of artifacts that are to be distributed via
the \fB.changes\fR control file.
.PP
The \fIdebian/files\fR file has a simple whitespace\-delimited format.
.Sp
.RS 4
\&\fIfilename\fR
\&\fIsection\fR
\&\fIpriority\fR
[
\&\fIkeyword=value...\fR
]
.RE
.PP
\&\fIfilename\fR
is the name of the artifact to distribute.
.PP
\&\fIsection\fR
and
\&\fIpriority\fR
correspond to the respective control fields available in the .deb.
The allowed values are specific to each distribution archive.
.PP
\&\fIkeyword=value...\fR
corresponds to an optional whitespace\-delimited list of attributes for this
entry.
The only currently supported keyword is \fBautomatic\fR with value
\&\fByes\fR, to mark automatically generated files.
.SH "نکات (NOTES)"
.IX Header "NOTES"
This file is not intended to be modified directly, please use one of
\&\fBdpkg\-gencontrol\fR or \fBdpkg\-distaddfile\fR to add entries to it.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.IX Header "SEE ALSO"
\&\fBdpkg\-genchanges\fR\|(1),
\&\fBdpkg\-distaddfile\fR\|(1).
